msgctxt "woh_comb:58"
msgid "BREAK INTO MINIVAN"
msgstr "闖入迷你廂型車"

msgctxt "woh_comb:59"
msgid "Maybe there's something useful in the gardener's minivan?"
msgstr "或許園丁的迷你廂型車裡會有實用的東西？"

msgctxt "woh_comb:60"
msgid "PROTECT THE GARDENER"
msgstr "保護園丁"

msgctxt "woh_comb:61"
msgid "This turn, the plants will attack you instead of SHIRO-SAN."
msgstr "本回合中，植物會攻擊你而不攻擊士郎先生。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:62"
msgid "The doorway"
msgstr "出入口"

msgctxt "woh_comb:63"
msgid ""
"The doorway is blocked by thick branches.\n"
"You need to find another way out!"
msgstr ""
"粗樹枝擋住了出入口。\n"
"你必須找到另一個出口！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:64"
msgid "CHOP YOUR WAY OUT"
msgstr "奮力砍出一條路"

msgctxt "woh_comb:65"
msgid "Using the FIRE AXE, you can quickly chop down the branches blocking the quick way out of this mansion!"
msgstr ""
"只要使用消防斧，\n"
"你就能迅速砍斷擋住豪宅出入口的樹枝！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:66"
msgid "LEAD THE GARDENER"
msgstr "帶領園丁"

msgctxt "woh_comb:67"
msgid "Continue leading the injured man outside. You'll need to perform this action multiple times to leave the mansion."
msgstr "將受傷的男人持續引導至外頭。你必須多次執行此行動，才能離開豪宅。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:68"
msgid "W-WHAT'S THAT?"
msgstr "那——那是什麼？"

msgctxt "woh_comb:69"
msgid "Stop and take a closer look at SHIRO-SAN's injuries."
msgstr "停下來仔細觀察士郎先生的傷勢。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:70"
msgid "Plants are attacking you! You must protect the injured SHIRO-SAN and lead him to safety. He will continue to lose HEALTH each turn."
msgstr ""
"植物正在攻擊你！\n"
"你必須保護受傷的士郎先生，並帶他到安全之處。\n"
"每回合他都會持續失去生命值。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:71"
msgid "[DEXTERITY-based]"
msgstr "[受敏捷影響]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:72"
msgid "[KNOWLEDGE-based]"
msgstr "[受知識影響]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:73"
msgid "DODGE"
msgstr "躲避"

msgctxt "woh_comb:74"
msgid "drastically lowers the hit chance for the enemy"
msgstr "大幅降低敵人的命中率"

msgctxt "woh_comb:75"
msgid "COMBAT SKILL"
msgstr "戰鬥技巧"

msgctxt "woh_comb:76"
msgid "reduces your EXPERIENCE by 5 and raises your chance to hit by 10% for the rest of this encounter"
msgstr "在本次戰鬥中降低 5 經驗並提高 10% 命中率"

msgctxt "woh_comb:77"
msgid "[STRENGTH-based]"
msgstr "[受力量影響]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:78"
msgid "BRACE FOR IMPACT"
msgstr "防禦"

msgctxt "woh_comb:79"
msgid "lowers the incoming damage by half and ignores any special attack"
msgstr "減半自身受到的傷害，並無視任何特殊攻擊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:80"
msgid "[CHARISMA-based]"
msgstr "[受魅力影響]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:81"
msgid "[LUCK-based]"
msgstr "[受幸運影響]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:82"
msgid "LAUNCH SEQUENCE"
msgstr "執行戰鬥序列"

msgctxt "woh_comb:83"
msgid "CLEAR"
msgstr "清除"

msgctxt "woh_comb:84"
msgid "TURN"
msgstr "回合"

msgctxt "woh_comb:85"
msgid "BEGINS!"
msgstr "開始！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:86"
msgid "OFFENSIVE ACTIONS"
msgstr "攻擊行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:87"
msgid "SUPPORT ACTIONS"
msgstr "輔助行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:88"
msgid "DEFENSIVE ACTIONS"
msgstr "防禦行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:89"
msgid "SPIRITUAL ACTIONS"
msgstr "靈異行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:90"
msgid "current time multiplier"
msgstr "目前時間倍數"

msgctxt "woh_comb:91"
msgid ""
"HEALTH - defines the enemy's stamina.\n"
"You win the encounter by getting this to zero."
msgstr ""
"生命值：為敵人的體力。\n"
"使生命值歸零就能在這場戰鬥中獲勝。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:92"
msgid "DAMAGE - after each sequence, enemies perform an attack draining your stamina (-STA), reason (-REA) or both (-ALL)."
msgstr "傷害：在執行完戰鬥序列中的行動後，敵人將透過攻擊削弱你的體力 (-STA)、理智 (-REA) 或同時削弱 (-ALL)。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:93"
msgid "POWER - this stat defines your chance to attack the enemy successfully. The higher its POWER, the harder it will be."
msgstr ""
"活力：成功攻擊敵人的機率。\n"
"敵人活力越高，攻擊成功的機率越低。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:94"
msgid "ATTACK WITH YOUR WEAPON"
msgstr "使用武器攻擊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:95"
msgid "[needs an equipped weapon to perform this action]"
msgstr "[必須裝備武器以執行此行動]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:96"
msgid "KICK"
msgstr "踢擊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:97"
msgid "[attack without a weapon]"
msgstr "[不使用武器攻擊]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:98"
msgid "STRONG ATTACK"
msgstr "強力攻擊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:99"
msgid "LOOK FOR AN IMPROVISED WEAPON"
msgstr "尋找臨時武器"

msgctxt "woh_comb:100"
msgid "pick up a random improvised weapon"
msgstr "隨機撿取一項臨時武器"

msgctxt "woh_comb:101"
msgid "You missed the attack!"
msgstr "你的攻擊未擊中！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:102"
msgid "You prepare to strike..."
msgstr "你準備好進行攻擊……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:103"
msgid ""
"[Fill the COMBAT SEQUENCE (white bar) with combat moves and click the 'LAUNCH SEQUENCE' to attack your enemy.]\n"
"\n"
"(right click) - delete the last combat move"
msgstr ""
"[選取各種戰鬥指令填入戰鬥序列（白色長條）後再點選「執行戰鬥序列」以攻擊敵人。]\n"
"\n"
"（點選滑鼠右鍵）：取消最後選取的戰鬥指令"

msgctxt "woh_comb:104"
msgid "[you can't run from this encounter]"
msgstr "[你無法逃離本次戰鬥]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:105"
msgid "RUN AWAY"
msgstr "逃跑"

msgctxt "woh_comb:106"
msgid "PREPARE YOUR ATTACK"
msgstr "準備攻擊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:107"
msgid "next attack is guaranteed to hit."
msgstr "下次攻擊必定命中。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:108"
msgid "ATTACK BOOST"
msgstr "攻擊加成"

msgctxt "woh_comb:109"
msgid "your next attack has an additional 10% chance to hit; this effect stacks"
msgstr "為下次攻擊增加 10% 的命中率，此效果可疊加"

msgctxt "woh_comb:110"
msgid "BITE"
msgstr "啃咬"

msgctxt "woh_comb:111"
msgid "You bite"
msgstr "你用牙齒咬了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:112"
msgid "Target"
msgstr "鎖定另"

msgctxt "woh_comb:113"
msgid "Target the other enemy."
msgstr "鎖定另一名敵人。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:114"
msgid "ASSESS THE SITUATION"
msgstr "分析現狀"

msgctxt "woh_comb:115"
msgid "learn about your enemy"
msgstr "了解敵人的情報"

msgctxt "woh_comb:116"
msgid "BOW"
msgstr "鞠躬"

msgctxt "woh_comb:117"
msgid ""
"a part of a ritual (Most combat rituals are a combination of five BOWS and CLAPS.\n"
"Even if you don't get it right, you'll be provided with a hint.)"
msgstr ""
"驅魂儀式的一部分\n"
"（儀式是由鞠躬與拍手組合而成的五個動作。\n"
"即使你錯了，系統還是會給予你提示。）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:118"
msgid "CLAP"
msgstr "拍手"

msgctxt "woh_comb:119"
msgid "NO HOPE!"
msgstr "沒希望了！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:120"
msgid "run from the horrible beast like a coward"
msgstr "像個膽小鬼一樣逃離可怕的野獸"

msgctxt "woh_comb:121"
msgid "THIS IS TOO MUCH!"
msgstr "再也受不了了！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:122"
msgid "You close your eyes, fighting the increasing dizziness..."
msgstr ""
"感到頭暈目眩的你決定閉上雙眼\n"
"以試著對抗這個難受的感覺……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:123"
msgid ""
"ends the encounter for a DOOM penalty\n"
"[+0% DOOM]"
msgstr ""
"結束戰鬥，接受末日懲罰\n"
"[+0% 末日]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:124"
msgid "(RUNNING SHOES)"
msgstr "（運動鞋）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:125"
msgid "% DOOM"
msgstr "% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_comb:126"
msgid "ends the encounter for a DOOM penalty"
msgstr "接受末日懲罰以結束戰鬥"

msgctxt "woh_comb:127"
msgid "FORCE MANHOLE OPEN (WITHOUT TOOL)"
msgstr "強行開啟人孔蓋（不使用工具）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:128"
msgid "try to open the manhole cover present in the janitor's office"
msgstr "嘗試開啟清潔工辦公室中的人孔蓋"

msgctxt "woh_comb:129"
msgid "FORCE MANHOLE OPEN (WITH TOOL)"
msgstr "強行開啟人孔蓋（使用工具）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:130"
msgid "TOPPLE A LAMP"
msgstr "推倒檯燈"

msgctxt "woh_comb:131"
msgid "a spark from the broken bulb should set the highly flammable cleaning fluids on fire..."
msgstr ""
"破損的燈泡產生的火花遇上易燃的清潔液……\n"
"火應該會燒得蠻旺的吧……？"

msgctxt "woh_comb:132"
msgid "PICK IT UP"
msgstr "撿起物品"

msgctxt "woh_comb:133"
msgid "RESOLVE COMBAT"
msgstr "結束戰鬥"

msgctxt "woh_comb:134"
msgid "You've defeated"
msgstr "你擊敗了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:135"
msgid "You punch"
msgstr "你揍了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:136"
msgid "You kick"
msgstr "你踢了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:137"
msgid "You stab"
msgstr "你捅了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:138"
msgid "You slash"
msgstr "你砍了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:139"
msgid "You shoot"
msgstr "你開槍射擊了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:140"
msgid "You bash"
msgstr "你痛打了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:141"
msgid "You saw through"
msgstr "你鋸斷了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:142"
msgid "You've successfully run from"
msgstr "你逃離"

msgctxt "woh_comb:143"
msgid "ESCAPE"
msgstr "逃跑"

msgctxt "woh_comb:144"
msgid "You burn"
msgstr "你用火燒傷了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:145"
msgid "You've found an item"
msgstr "你找到一個物品"

msgctxt "woh_comb:146"
msgid "Wait, what's that?"
msgstr "等等，地上那是什麼？"

msgctxt "woh_comb:147"
msgid "You don't have time to change the equipment."
msgstr "你沒時間變更裝備。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:148"
msgid "You've already defeated the enemy."
msgstr "你已擊敗敵人。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:149"
msgid "This action needs a target enemy."
msgstr "此行動需要敵人作為目標。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:150"
msgid "KAORI YUTO"
msgstr "由藤香織"

msgctxt "woh_comb:151"
msgid ""
"THE LINGUIST\n"
"[+1 COMBAT DAMAGE]"
msgstr ""
"語言學家\n"
"[+1 戰鬥傷害]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:152"
msgid "SAKINA OKADA"
msgstr "岡田咲菜"

msgctxt "woh_comb:153"
msgid ""
"THE GEOLOGIST\n"
"[+1 COMBAT DAMAGE]"
msgstr ""
"地質學家\n"
"[+1 戰鬥傷害]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:154"
msgid "HIROKI SHINOHE"
msgstr "篠瀨宏樹"

msgctxt "woh_comb:155"
msgid ""
"THE THEOLOGIST\n"
"[-1 INCOMING DAMAGE]"
msgstr ""
"神學家\n"
"[受到傷害 -1]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:156"
msgid "Inside the minivan, you find a can of flammable gas..."
msgstr "你在迷你廂型車中發現了一瓶可燃瓦斯……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:157"
msgid "You can't find anything useful anymore..."
msgstr "你找不到任何實用的東西了……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:158"
msgid "You prepare to protect the gardener..."
msgstr "你準備好要保護園丁……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:159"
msgid "You help SHIRO-SAN walk towards the exit."
msgstr "你協助士郎先生走向出口。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:160"
msgid "You've escaped the basement but SHIRO-SAN follows you!"
msgstr "你逃出了地下室，但士郎先生也緊追在後！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:161"
msgid "The top of SHIRO-SAN's head flies off, revealing his brain! Out of it bursts the fruiting body of a fungus!"
msgstr "士郎先生頭顱的上半部飛離，腦袋也跟著露了出來！上面長滿了真菌的子實體！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:162"
msgid "You try to sever their ties to this world!"
msgstr "你試圖斬斷敵人與現世的連結！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:163"
msgid "You burn the money! (-1 FUNDS)"
msgstr "你燃燒金錢！（-1 金錢）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:164"
msgid "[SOMETHING TRULY EVIL REQUIRES MORE]"
msgstr "[惡之根源還不滿足]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:165"
msgid "[YOU'VE BLED ENOUGH]"
msgstr "[血流得夠多了]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:166"
msgid "[YOU'LL RETURN...]"
msgstr "[你將會返回……]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:167"
msgid "[YOU'VE GIVEN UP ALREADY]"
msgstr "[你早已放棄]"

msgctxt "woh_comb:168"
msgid "has managed to distract"
msgstr "成功支開了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:169"
msgid "has tried to distract"
msgstr "試圖要支開"

msgctxt "woh_comb:170"
msgid "but died!"
msgstr "卻不幸被殺了！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:171"
msgid "You don't have any allies left!"
msgstr "你一名夥伴也不剩了！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:172"
msgid "You throw"
msgstr "你扔出"

msgctxt "woh_comb:173"
msgid "on the altar and stab them in the chest! (-3 REASON)"
msgstr "在祭壇上，捅進了他的胸口！（-3 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:174"
msgid "The ritual makes you stronger! (+1 STAT)"
msgstr "儀式讓你變得更為強大！（+1 數值）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:175"
msgid "Dodging an attack, you unplug the life support machine of one of the patients."
msgstr "你在躲避敵人的攻擊後，拔除了一名病患的維生系統。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:176"
msgid "The patient dies and one of the tendrils disappears... (-15 HEALTH)"
msgstr "病患失去了呼吸心跳，其中一根觸手也消失了……（-15 生命值）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:177"
msgid "Reality shifts, your action was canceled."
msgstr "現實改變，你的行動被取消。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:178"
msgid "Time freezes, your action was canceled."
msgstr "時間停滯，你的行動被取消。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:179"
msgid "You grab a knife and stab one of the family members!"
msgstr "你拿了一把刀，並捅向其中一位家族成員！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:180"
msgid "HORRIBLE OLD MAN recoils in pain! (-15 damage)"
msgstr "邪惡老人痛苦地縮成一團！（-15 傷害）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:181"
msgid "HORRIBLE OLD MAN... smiles."
msgstr "邪惡老人……露出微笑。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:182"
msgid "You brace yourself for an incoming attack!"
msgstr "你準備好承受攻擊！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:183"
msgid "You prepare yourself to dodge the incoming attack!"
msgstr "你準備好躲避攻擊！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:184"
msgid "It's your final chance! Don't waste it!"
msgstr "這是你最後的機會！別浪費了！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:185"
msgid "You meditate! (+1 REASON, -2 STAMINA)"
msgstr "你開始冥想！（+1 理智，-2 體力）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:186"
msgid "You attack the chanting cultist, dealing"
msgstr "你攻擊念咒中的邪教徒，造成"

msgctxt "woh_comb:187"
msgid "damage!"
msgstr "傷害！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:188"
msgid "The enemy is repeating a magical incantation!..."
msgstr "敵人正在反覆唸誦一道魔咒……！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:189"
msgid "The enemy is repeating meaningless facts!..."
msgstr "敵人正在反覆說著一些無意義的資訊……！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:190"
msgid "The enemy suddenly gets silent and starts staring at you...."
msgstr "敵人突然安靜下來，開始盯著你看……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:191"
msgid "You pray! (+1 STAMINA, -2 REASON)"
msgstr "你開始祈禱！（+1 體力，-2 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:192"
msgid "The gunshot is deafening!"
msgstr "槍聲使你感到耳鳴！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:193"
msgid "You study the movement of the enemy, finding an opening!"
msgstr "你觀察敵人的動作，試圖找到空隙！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:194"
msgid "Not enough EXPERIENCE for that action!"
msgstr "目前的經驗不足以執行此行動！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:195"
msgid "You try to open the manhole..."
msgstr "你嘗試開啟人孔蓋……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:196"
msgid "It would be easier with a proper tool, though."
msgstr "如果有個適當的工具，應該會更好打開。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:197"
msgid "Using a crowbar, you try to open the manhole..."
msgstr "你嘗試用撬棍開啟人孔蓋……"

msgctxt "woh_comb:198"
msgid "health"
msgstr "生命值"

msgctxt "woh_comb:199"
msgid "You bow"
msgstr "你鞠躬"

msgctxt "woh_comb:200"
msgid "You clap"
msgstr "你拍手"

msgctxt "woh_comb:201"
msgid "You duck down and grab an item lying on the ground."
msgstr "你蹲低後撿起了地上的物品。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:202"
msgid "COMBAT TUTORIAL"
msgstr "戰鬥教學"

msgctxt "woh_comb:203"
msgid ""
"During each turn, you'll build a sequence of attacks and moves from the action ring (B).\n"
"Once you've filled the sequence bar (C), press the LAUNCH SEQUENCE button to finish your turn."
msgstr ""
"在每一回合，你將在此面板上構築一系列的攻擊與行動 (B)。\n"
"當你將行動填入序列條 (C) 之後，請按下「執行戰鬥序列」按鈕以結束你的回合。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:204"
msgid ""
"With time, you will discover new combat moves, available through the ACTION FILTER (A).\n"
"But first, you need a weapon. Find and choose an action called 'LOOK FOR AN IMPROVISED WEAPON'"
msgstr ""
"隨著遊戲的進行，各種新的戰鬥指令也會開始出現在行動過濾工具 (A) 內。\n"
"但你必須先有把堪用的武器。請找出並點選「尋找臨時武器」這個行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:205"
msgid "Look, a new ITEM has appeared in your INVENTORY in the upper right corner. Select the ITEM with your cursor and open this ITEM's sub-menu, then select the EQUIP button (highlighted)."
msgstr "有發現右上角的物品欄裡面多了一項新的物品嗎？使用游標點選物品後將會開啟物品的副選單，接著請點選裝備鈕（閃爍處）。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:206"
msgid "USE"
msgstr "使用"

msgctxt "woh_comb:207"
msgid "EQUIP - places item in its equipment SLOT"
msgstr "裝備：將物品放進裝備欄"

msgctxt "woh_comb:208"
msgid "INSPECT - additional information about the item"
msgstr "檢查：顯示更多物品的資訊"

msgctxt "woh_comb:209"
msgid "STORAGE - places item in the storage"
msgstr "儲物箱：將物品放入儲物箱"

msgctxt "woh_comb:210"
msgid "THROW AT ENEMY - throws the item at the enemy"
msgstr "丟向敵人：將物品丟向敵人"

msgctxt "woh_comb:211"
msgid "DISCARD - removes the item from the game"
msgstr "丟棄：將物品自遊戲中移除"

msgctxt "woh_comb:212"
msgid "TRADE IN - sell this item"
msgstr "交易：販賣此物品"

msgctxt "woh_comb:213"
msgid "YOU WOULDN'T KNOW WHERE TO FIND A BUYER FOR IT"
msgstr "你找不到地方賣這個物品"

msgctxt "woh_comb:214"
msgid "TALK"
msgstr "交談"

msgctxt "woh_comb:215"
msgid "LET GO"
msgstr "放走"

msgctxt "woh_comb:216"
msgid "KILL"
msgstr "殺害"

msgctxt "woh_comb:217"
msgid "SEND AGAINST ENEMY"
msgstr "派去對付敵人"

msgctxt "woh_comb:218"
msgid "CAST THIS SPELL"
msgstr "施放此咒語"

msgctxt "woh_comb:219"
msgid "FORGET THIS SPELL (+1 REASON)"
msgstr "遺忘此咒語（+1 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:220"
msgid "AURA: FREE CAST"
msgstr "光環：免費施放"

msgctxt "woh_comb:221"
msgid "ATH-YOLAZSTH'S GAZE: CASTING THIS DOESN'T COST REASON"
msgstr "亞托 ‧ 尤拉斯的凝視：施放此咒語不花費理智"

msgctxt "woh_comb:222"
msgid "TREATMENT - 1 FUNDS"
msgstr "治療：-1 金錢"

msgctxt "woh_comb:223"
msgid "SURGERY - 2 FUNDS"
msgstr "手術：-2 金錢"

msgctxt "woh_comb:224"
msgid "MODERN MEDICINE CAN'T HELP HERE"
msgstr "現代藥物無法派上用場"

msgctxt "woh_comb:225"
msgid "BANDAGE THIS WOUND"
msgstr "包紮傷口"

msgctxt "woh_comb:226"
msgid "PRICK IT WITH A NEEDLE"
msgstr "用針刺"

msgctxt "woh_comb:227"
msgid "TREAT THIS WOUND"
msgstr "處理傷口"

msgctxt "woh_comb:228"
msgid "REMOVE CURSE"
msgstr "移除詛咒"

msgctxt "woh_comb:229"
msgid "^ AVAILABLE ACTIONS"
msgstr "^ 可用行動"

msgctxt "woh_comb:230"
msgid "Item added to the storage!"
msgstr "物品被放入了儲物箱！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:231"
msgid "You can't store items you are wearing."
msgstr "你無法存放穿戴中的物品。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:232"
msgid "The thrown item damages the enemy!"
msgstr "丟出的物品對敵人造成了傷害！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:233"
msgid ""
"You prick it with a needle. A geyser of foul-smelling whitish-yellow pus bursts out and you scream in pain! S-shouldn't a doctor see this?...\n"
"(-2 STAMINA, -1 MAX STAMINA)"
msgstr ""
"你用針刺進去後，從傷口噴出了味道難聞的淡黃色膿汁。你痛到忍不住哀嚎！\n"
"好像應該先去給醫生看才對……？（-2 體力，-1 體力上限）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:234"
msgid "The treatment was successful!"
msgstr "治療很成功！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:235"
msgid "You can't afford that!"
msgstr "你沒錢支付醫療費用！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:236"
msgid "The surgery was successful!"
msgstr "手術很成功！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:237"
msgid "Your ally"
msgstr "你的夥伴"

msgctxt "woh_comb:238"
msgid "attacked"
msgstr "攻擊了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:239"
msgid "to protect you!"
msgstr "以保護你！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:240"
msgid "That attack dealt"
msgstr "該攻擊造成"

msgctxt "woh_comb:241"
msgid "damage"
msgstr "傷害"

msgctxt "woh_comb:242"
msgid "You kill"
msgstr "你殺了"

msgctxt "woh_comb:243"
msgid "for plotting against you!"
msgstr "，因為你懷疑這個人想陷害你！"

msgctxt "woh_comb:244"
msgid "You forgot this spell! (+ REASON)"
msgstr "你遺忘了此咒語（+ 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:245"
msgid "No Weapon"
msgstr "未裝備武器"

msgctxt "woh_comb:246"
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "未裝備"

msgctxt "woh_comb:247"
msgid "current backstory:"
msgstr "目前背景故事："

msgctxt "woh_comb:248"
msgid "CHANGE BACKSTORY"
msgstr "變更背景故事"

msgctxt "woh_comb:249"
msgid "START THE GAME"
msgstr "開始遊戲"

msgctxt "woh_comb:250"
msgid "STAMINA"
msgstr "體力"

msgctxt "woh_comb:251"
msgid "REASON"
msgstr "理智"

msgctxt "woh_comb:252"
msgid "DOOM"
msgstr "末日"

msgctxt "woh_comb:253"
msgid "NO RITUAL ACTIVE"
msgstr "無進行中的儀式"

msgctxt "woh_comb:254"
msgid ""
"Welcome and thank you for trying WORLD OF HORROR.\n"
"Inspired by adventure games from the 80s, the visual overload may initially be a little disorienting. In this short tutorial, I'll do my best to explain various elements and prepare you to fight the horrible OLD GODS.\n"
"- Pawel, creator of the game"
msgstr ""
"歡迎並感謝你遊玩《WORLD OF HORROR》。\n"
"由於製作本遊戲的靈感來自 1980 年代的冒險遊戲，所以在整體視覺上可能會一時讓你有點迷失。在這簡短的教學中，我會盡力解釋不同要素，並讓你做好準備，以對抗可怕的古神。\n"
"- 遊戲製作者 Pawel"

msgctxt "woh_comb:255"
msgid "That's the -MAIN GAME SCREEN-. Here, you will interact with your surroundings, solve mysteries and fight enemies."
msgstr "這是「主遊戲畫面」。你會在此與周圍的人事物互動、調查謎團並與敵人戰鬥。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:256"
msgid ""
"That's the -USER INTERFACE- part of the screen. \n"
"\n"
"Here, you'll manage your inventory, cast spells and access the game options."
msgstr ""
"畫面的這個部分是\n"
"「使用者介面」。\n"
"\n"
"你會在此管理物品欄、施放咒語與調整遊戲選項。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:257"
msgid "All performed actions will be added to the -LOG- here."
msgstr "所有執行的行動都會列入這裡的「記錄」中。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:258"
msgid ""
"That's you on the right. WORLD OF HORROR has RPG elements and your attributes are described by six basic stats.\n"
"\n"
"Move your cursor over them to learn more."
msgstr ""
"右邊那個人就是你的角色。\n"
"《WORLD OF HORROR》有著 RPG 的要素，\n"
"而你的屬性會分別以六種基礎數值表示。\n"
"\n"
"將游標移至數值上方可以獲得更多資訊。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:259"
msgid "Your ability to continue your investigation is determined by STAMINA and REASON. If either of them reaches zero, the game ends."
msgstr "你能否繼續調查的能力是由「體力」與「理智」所決定。若兩者之中有一項歸零，遊戲就結束了。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:260"
msgid ""
"That's your INVENTORY. You can keep up to four items.\n"
"To inspect, use, or equip anything you pick up, select the item in question from this area."
msgstr ""
"那是你的物品欄。你最多能攜帶四項物品。\n"
"若要檢視、使用或裝備任何物品，\n"
"請在此區域進行選取。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:261"
msgid ""
"There are three EQUIPMENT SLOTS. Equipped items do not count towards the four items limit.\n"
"A - weapon used in combat\n"
"B and C - trinkets and armor"
msgstr ""
"裝備欄一共有三格。\n"
"最多攜帶四項物品的限制並不包含裝備中的物品。\n"
"A：戰鬥中使用的武器\n"
"B 與 C：飾品與裝備"

msgctxt "woh_comb:262"
msgid "Additional TABS will take you to your SPELLS, current STATUS and OPTIONS."
msgstr "其餘圖示則可讓你檢視咒語、目前狀態與選項。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:263"
msgid "That's your (STA) stamina. It represents your physical health. Once it reaches zero, your character dies."
msgstr "這是你的體力 (STA)。這項數值會顯示出你生理的健康程度。一旦歸零，你的角色就會死亡。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:264"
msgid "That's your (REA) reason. It represents your stability and will to confront the horrors. Once it reaches zero, your character collapses and the game ends."
msgstr "這是你的理智 (REA)。這項數值會顯示出你面對恐怖的穩定度與意志。一旦歸零，你的角色就會徹底崩潰，遊戲也會在此結束。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:265"
msgid "That's (STR) Strength. Stats are used to determine the outcome of events and the speed of certain combat actions."
msgstr ""
"這是力量 (STR)。\n"
"數值大小會影響事件結果和某些特定戰鬥行動的速度。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:266"
msgid "That's (DEX) Dexterity. Stats are used to determine the outcome of events and the speed of certain combat actions."
msgstr ""
"這是敏捷 (DEX)。\n"
"數值大小會影響事件結果和某些特定戰鬥行動的速度。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:267"
msgid "That's (PER) Perception. Stats are used to determine the outcome of events and the speed of certain combat actions."
msgstr ""
"這是感知 (PER)。\n"
"數值大小會影響事件結果和某些特定戰鬥行動的速度。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:268"
msgid "That's (KNW) Knowledge. Stats are used to determine the outcome of events and the speed of certain combat actions."
msgstr ""
"這是知識 (KNW)。\n"
"數值大小會影響事件結果和某些特定戰鬥行動的速度。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:269"
msgid "That's (CHA) Charisma. Stats are used to determine the outcome of events and the speed of certain combat actions."
msgstr ""
"這是魅力 (CHA)。\n"
"數值大小會影響事件結果和某些特定戰鬥行動的速度。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:270"
msgid "That's (FND) Funds, representing the amount of money you can spend."
msgstr ""
"這是金錢 (FND)。\n"
"這項數值會顯示出你目前可花費的金錢量。"

msgctxt "woh_comb:271"
msgid "As you progress with your playthrough, more helpful tips will appear. Would you like to turn the combat tutorial on? (It will start during your first enemy encounter)"
msgstr ""
"在遊玩的過程中，會出現更多實用的小提示。\n"
"你想開啟戰鬥教學嗎？（教學將在你遭遇第一名敵人時開始）"

msgctxt "woh_comb:272"
msgid "The enemy seems to be weak against this type of weapon! (+ DAMAGE)"
msgstr "這類型的武器似乎能攻擊到敵人的弱點！（+ 傷害）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:0"
msgid "---KTU-RUFU, THE DREAMING---"
msgstr "——夢境之神，庫圖 ‧ 盧夫——"

msgctxt "woh_dec:1"
msgid "The gargantuan body of KTU-RUFU lies submerged within a sunken city, where its boundless reveries sow turmoil and insanity. When the stars are right, KTU-RUFU will awaken once more, and the nightmare shall begin..."
msgstr "如山一般巨大的庫圖 ‧ 盧夫沉睡於一座海底的都市之中，而祂無邊際的幻夢也將此處化作滋養失序混沌的溫床。當繁星抵達正確的位置時，庫圖 ‧ 盧夫就會甦醒並將世界籠罩在噩夢之中……"

msgctxt "woh_dec:2"
msgid "NIGHTMARES: Losing REASON raises DOOM."
msgstr "無止盡的噩夢：失去理智時將提升末日"

msgctxt "woh_dec:3"
msgid "DREAMING OF SHIOKAWA"
msgstr "夢境中的鹽川"

msgctxt "woh_dec:4"
msgid "The gargantuan body of KTU-RUFU lies submerged within a sunken city, where its boundless reveries sow turmoil and insanity. When the stars are right, KTU-RUFU will awaken once more, and the nightmare shall begin..."
msgstr "如山一般巨大的庫圖 ‧ 盧夫沉睡於一座海底的都市之中，而祂無邊際的幻夢也將此處化作滋養失序混沌的溫床。當繁星抵達正確的位置時，庫圖 ‧ 盧夫就會甦醒並將世界籠罩在噩夢之中……"

msgctxt "woh_dec:5"
msgid "[losing REASON raises DOOM]"
msgstr "[失去理智時將提升末日]"

msgctxt "woh_dec:6"
msgid "KTU-RUFU"
msgstr "庫圖 ‧ 盧夫"

msgctxt "woh_dec:7"
msgid "The prophecy was right, and there was nothing you could do to stop it. KTU-RUFU's dream of SHIOKAWA has ended."
msgstr "預言成真，而你只能任憑這件事發生。庫圖 ‧ 盧夫夢境中的鹽川就在此刻完結了。"

msgctxt "woh_dec:8"
msgid "Being a part of this dream, you and everyone you know have ceased to exist..."
msgstr "置身在這場夢境的你和你熟悉的人事物，都已不復存在……"

msgctxt "woh_dec:9"
msgid "Just a dream?..."
msgstr "只是一場夢……？"

msgctxt "woh_dec:10"
msgid "JUST A DREAM?"
msgstr "只是一場夢……？"

msgctxt "woh_dec:11"
msgid "lower DOOM by 2% at the end of the mystery"
msgstr "謎團結束時降低 2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_dec:12"
msgid "<<was it all just a dream?>>"
msgstr "「剛才都只是一場夢……？」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:13"
msgid "HALLUCINATIONS"
msgstr "幻象"

msgctxt "woh_dec:14"
msgid "-1 PERCEPTION"
msgstr "-1 感知"

msgctxt "woh_dec:15"
msgid "<<...he's not real...>>"
msgstr "「……眼前的他只是假象……」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:16"
msgid "FLASHBACKS"
msgstr "過往的記憶"

msgctxt "woh_dec:17"
msgid ""
"-2 DEXTERITY\n"
"(discard): +4% DOOM"
msgstr ""
"-2 敏捷\n"
"（丟棄）：+4% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_dec:18"
msgid "<<they can't find the body>>"
msgstr "「他們不可能找到那具屍體」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:19"
msgid "TAINTED VIOLIN"
msgstr "受汙染的小提琴"

msgctxt "woh_dec:20"
msgid "(equip): faster combat actions"
msgstr "（裝備）：提升戰鬥行動的速度"

msgctxt "woh_dec:21"
msgid "Its wood has soaked in a curious dark red liquid."
msgstr "琴身曾被浸泡在詭異的暗紅色液體之中。"

msgctxt "woh_dec:22"
msgid "You can't get the stains out."
msgstr "你擦不掉上面的污漬。"

msgctxt "woh_dec:23"
msgid "HOLY GLYPHS"
msgstr "神聖符號"

msgctxt "woh_dec:24"
msgid ""
"lower DOOM by 1% for every item in your inventory\n"
"[discard on use]\n"
"[COST: 2 REASON]"
msgstr ""
"施放此咒語時降低的末日 %，\n"
"等同於物品欄中物品的數量\n"
"[使用後丟棄]\n"
"[花費：2 理智]"

msgctxt "woh_dec:25"
msgid "THE NORWEGIAN"
msgstr "挪威風"

msgctxt "woh_dec:26"
msgid "BAD DREAMS"
msgstr "噩夢纏身"

msgctxt "woh_dec:27"
msgid ""
"Staying up is becoming harder and harder for you, but the horrible nightmares you've been having lately worry you.\n"
"\n"
"What if you couldn't wake up from one?"
msgstr ""
"你越來越難以保持清醒，\n"
"但你也不想面對那持續糾纏著你的噩夢。\n"
"\n"
"要是你哪一天無法從噩夢中醒過來，那該怎麼辦？"

msgctxt "woh_dec:28"
msgid "give in; your body needs it"
msgstr "別想太多，你的身體需要睡眠"

msgctxt "woh_dec:29"
msgid "you can't go to sleep now"
msgstr "再撐一下下"

msgctxt "woh_dec:30"
msgid ""
"Your nightmares are getting more realistic each time you close your eyes, but your body feels rested, and you're ready for action.\n"
"(+1 STAMINA / -3 REASON)"
msgstr ""
"雖然你的噩夢一場比一場還逼真，\n"
"但起碼你睡了個好覺，而你也準備好繼續行動。\n"
"（+1 體力/-3 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:31"
msgid ""
"You drink another cup of coffee, praying that your body will get used to it.\n"
"(+STATUS)"
msgstr ""
"你又喝了一杯咖啡。\n"
"希望自己能逐漸適應這種不規律的作息……\n"
"（+ 狀態）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:32"
msgid "MASK FESTIVAL"
msgstr "面具祭典"

msgctxt "woh_dec:33"
msgid ""
"As you glance around, you notice that more and more people are wearing strange masks, unlike anything you've ever seen before.\n"
"As you turn to your friends for reassurance, you notice that some also wear these eerie masks. Their voices sound muffled and distorted, and you can't shake off the feeling that they're not quite themselves.\n"
"The hairs on the back of your neck stand on end, and you realize something is terribly wrong."
msgstr ""
"周圍越來越多人開始戴起了詭異的面具，\n"
"而你對這樣的景象感到非常陌生。\n"
"你想和旁邊的朋友討論這件事，但你卻發現他們也戴上了那奇怪的面具。朋友的聲音低沉而扭曲，就像是完全變了個人一樣。\n"
"\n"
"眼前的景象讓你寒毛直豎。事情似乎哪裡不太對勁……"

msgctxt "woh_dec:34"
msgid "<<They are preparing for something...>>"
msgstr "「他們在防範著什麼……」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:35"
msgid "<<This can't be healthy!>>"
msgstr "「一定是有髒東西跑了進來！」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:36"
msgid "<<Are they hiding something?>>"
msgstr "「他們在隱藏著什麼嗎？」"

msgctxt "woh_dec:37"
msgid ""
"A sense of dread creeps over you, as the masked people are swarming through the store, filling their carts with food and survival equipment.\n"
"You notice the goods' prices have already skyrocketed.\n"
"\n"
"You realize that you need to act fast if you want to have any chance of survival.\n"
"(-2 FUNDS)"
msgstr ""
"戴面具的群眾紛紛湧進商店，將架上的食物和避難用品給一掃而空。\n"
"此外，你發現各類商品的價格突然都飆漲了好幾倍。\n"
"\n"
"如果想要存活下來，你最好趕快展開行動。\n"
"（-2 金錢）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:38"
msgid ""
"What are they protecting themselves against? You take a deep breath and the air around you feels heavy as if it's thick with an invisible poison. You cough, and your eyes begin to water.\n"
"\n"
"The world around you is not as safe as you once thought. .\n"
"(-2 STAMINA)"
msgstr ""
"他們戴著面具，是想免於受到什麼東西的侵害嗎？\n"
"你深吸了一口氣之後，\n"
"發現空氣中似乎瀰漫著一股無形的毒氣。\n"
"你不由自主地開始咳嗽，眼睛也分泌出了大量液體。\n"
"\n"
"這個世界看來沒有你過去所想的那麼安全。\n"
"（-2 體力）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:39"
msgid ""
"You can't help but wonder what lies behind the masks that conceal the faces of the people around you.\n"
"\n"
"Are these even the people they claim to be? Or are they just masquerading as something they're not, hiding their true identities behind the masks that they wear?\n"
"(-2 REASON)"
msgstr ""
"群眾的面具底下究竟隱藏著什麼秘密？\n"
"\n"
"他們是人類，還是某種宣稱是人類的生物？他們該不會是為了隱藏自己的真實身分，才選擇要戴上面具？\n"
"（-2 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:40"
msgid "CRUMBLING REALITY"
msgstr "逐漸崩壞的現實"

msgctxt "woh_dec:41"
msgid ""
"The line between your dreams and reality has blurred beyond recognition, and you can't tell what's real anymore.\n"
"As you struggle to hold on to your sanity, a sense of panic takes hold. The world around you starts to warp and distort, and you can feel yourself slipping further and further away from reality.\n"
"\n"
"WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP WAKE UP"
msgstr ""
"夢境和現實之間的界線已經模糊到你無法分清兩者之間的差異。\n"
"在你努力想保持理性時，內心的一陣恐慌卻又打亂了腦中的思緒。你周圍的世界開始扭曲變形，現實似乎也離你越來越遙遠。\n"
"\n"
"快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 \n"
"快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒 快醒醒"

msgctxt "woh_dec:42"
msgid ""
"IÄ! IÄ!\n"
"KTU-RUFU FHTAGN!"
msgstr ""
"萬歲！萬歲！\n"
"庫圖 ‧ 盧夫！"

msgctxt "woh_dec:43"
msgid "let the DIMENSIONAL VOYEUR devour you"
msgstr "任憑次元窺視者將你給吞噬"

msgctxt "woh_dec:44"
msgid "fight against this feeling"
msgstr "抗拒這種感受"

msgctxt "woh_dec:45"
msgid ""
"KTU-RUFU will rise once again and the world as you know it is about to be consumed by darkness!!\n"
"(+10 EXPERIENCE / +2% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"庫圖 ‧ 盧夫會再次崛起，\n"
"而你熟悉的這個世界，\n"
"也將被無盡的黑暗給吞噬殆盡。\n"
"（+10 經驗/+2% 末日）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:46"
msgid ""
"You try to fight it, to deny the hunger that can never be sated, but deep down, you know it's no use.\n"
"\n"
"You slowly close your eyes...\n"
"(+3 EXPERIENCE)"
msgstr ""
"雖然你試著想抵抗那無法被滿足的食慾，但你內心知道這一切都只是徒勞。\n"
"\n"
"於是，你閉上了雙眼……（+3 經驗）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:47"
msgid ""
"this can't be happening\n"
"this can't be happening\n"
"this can't be hap-\n"
"\n"
"You open your eyes, half expecting to find yourself in the grip of a nightmare. But everything seems normal. Too normal.\n"
"(+4 REASON)"
msgstr ""
"這一切都是幻覺\n"
"這一切都是幻覺\n"
"這一切都是幻……\n"
"\n"
"你睜開眼睛，猜到自己剛才大概是陷入了一場噩夢。\n"
"但現在一切都好正常。有點太正常了……\n"
"（+4 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:48"
msgid ""
"The world around you warps and twists in a dizzying display of madness, pushing you to the brink of insanity. You try to hold on, but it's too much, and you collapse in a heap on the ground...\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, you're jolted back to reality by a police officer staring down at you with confusion and suspicion..\n"
"(-2 STAMINA)"
msgstr ""
"周圍扭曲變形的世界使你彷彿置身在狂亂的萬花筒之中，而這個景象也將你的精神推向了崩潰邊緣。你試著保持理性，但你最終還是因為無法承受這一切而不支倒地……\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"突然間，你從夢境中回到了現實。一名員警將你給搖醒，而他的眼神中不僅充滿了困惑，還隱約透露出對你的懷疑……（-2 體力）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:49"
msgid "BOX CUTTER (BROKEN)"
msgstr "美工刀（毀損）"

msgctxt "woh_dec:50"
msgid "Your BOX CUTTER's blade broke!"
msgstr "美工刀的刀片斷掉了！"

msgctxt "woh_dec:51"
msgid "MIMI'S LITTLE PROJECT"
msgstr "美美的小實驗"

msgctxt "woh_dec:52"
msgid "<<this will deal with these annoying floaters...>>"
msgstr "「這樣應該能治好那惱人的飛蚊症……」"

