msgid "You must commit yourself to one of your projects before continuing your investigation."
msgstr "你得先完成其中一項小實驗，才能繼續進行調查。"

msgctxt "woh_dec:55"
msgid "With the next project completed, you should continue your investigation."
msgstr "實驗完成，你可以繼續進行調查了。"

msgctxt "woh_dec:56"
