msgstr "尤果帖古"

msgctxt "woh_home:119"
msgid "---GOIZO, THE THING FORSAKEN BY GOD---"
msgstr "——神棄之物 戈佐——"

msgctxt "woh_home:120"
msgid "Banished to the other dimension a long time ago, GOIZO has found a way to use mirrors to ensnare and teleport its prey straight through reflective glass. The glimpses behind your reflections are just the beginning of a real nightmare."
msgstr "戈佐在很久以前，就被放逐至其他次元。儘管如此，祂仍然能透過鏡中的反射，來誘捕並傳送任何祂盯上的獵物。你在鏡中感受到的眼神，不過是這場噩夢的開端。"

msgctxt "woh_home:121"
msgid "MIRROR HORROR: Resting increases DOOM penalty"
msgstr "鏡像恐怖：提高在家休息時的末日懲罰"

msgctxt "woh_home:122"
msgid "THE THING FORSAKEN BY GOD"
msgstr "神棄之物"

msgctxt "woh_home:123"
msgid ""
"Banished to the other dimension a long time ago, GOIZO has found a way to use mirrors to ensnare and teleport its prey straight through reflective glass.\n"
"\n"
"The glimpses behind your reflections are just the beginning of a real nightmare."
msgstr ""
"戈佐在很久以前，就被放逐至其他次元。儘管如此，祂仍然能透過鏡中的反射，來誘捕並傳送任何祂盯上的獵物。\n"
"\n"
"你在鏡中感受到的眼神，不過是這場噩夢的開端。"

