msgid "<<What's that smell?>>"
msgstr "「那是什麼味道？」"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:18"
msgid "PROTECTIVE CARVINGS"
msgstr "保護刻印"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:19"
msgid ""
"receive -1 DAMAGE during combat encounters\n"
"[COST: 4 STAMINA]"
msgstr ""
"戰鬥期間 -1 受到的傷害\n"
"[花費：4 體力]"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:20"
msgid "You carve the protective symbols on your chest and arms... (-4 STAMINA)"
msgstr "你在自己的胸口與雙臂上，刻下能保護自己的符號……（-4 體力）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:21"
msgid ""
"PROTECTIVE CARVINGS\n"
"[-1 DAMAGE received]"
msgstr ""
"保護刻印\n"
"[ -1 傷害]"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:22"
msgid "BLOOD FRENZY"
msgstr "鮮血狂怒"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:23"
msgid ""
"+1 DAMAGE / receive additional combat damage\n"
"(discard): lose 3 STAMINA"
msgstr ""
"+1 傷害/受到的傷害增加\n"
"（丟棄）：失去 3 體力"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:24"
msgid "<<is that paint?>>"
msgstr "「那是顏料嗎？」"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:25"
msgid "EIMI"
msgstr "詠美"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:26"
msgid "completing a mystery regains 1 REASON"
msgstr "解開謎團時恢復 1 理智"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:27"
msgid "<<thanks for saving me>>"
msgstr "「謝謝你救了我」"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:28"
msgid "[gallery curator]"
msgstr "[畫廊策展人]"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:29"
msgid ""
"\n"
"[EIMI]: +1 REASON"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"[詠美]：+1 理智"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:30"
msgid "UCHIDA"
msgstr "內田"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:31"
msgid "EXP bonus for assessing situation during combat (once per enemy)"
msgstr ""
"戰鬥時進行現況的分析後，\n"
"將獲得經驗的加成（每位敵人限一次）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:32"
msgid "'heavy breathing'"
msgstr "「哈啊……哈啊……」"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:33"
msgid "[otaku creep]"
msgstr "[詭異宅男]"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:34"
msgid "UCHIDA stammers some facts about your enemy. (+7 EXP)"
msgstr "內田結巴地向你透露一些敵人的資訊。（+7 經驗）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:35"
msgid "T'CITHURA"
msgstr "齊修拉"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:36"
msgid ""
"As you get closer to the bridge leading out of the village, MATSUDA-SAN suddenly stops.\n"
"<<I... know this tune...>>\n"
"\n"
"Before you can react, he begins to undress and runs into the darkness. Shocked, you begin to hear a faint moaning coming from the rock formation.\n"
"What you see there feels unreal. All the villagers are naked! They are dancing around the pillars as something slowly emerges from the river..."
msgstr ""
"當你靠近通往村子之外的橋時，松田先生猛然止步。\n"
"「我……認得這個旋律……」\n"
"\n"
"在你來得及反應前，他就脫去了衣服，跑向了一片黑暗。\n"
"在受到驚嚇後，你開始聽見從岩石後方傳來的微弱呻吟聲。\n"
"你在那裡看見的情景超乎你的想像。所有村民都全身赤裸！\n"
"他們圍繞著柱子群跳舞，同時有東西緩緩自河面浮出……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:37"
msgid "T'CITHURA'S DANCE"
msgstr "齊修拉之舞"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:38"
msgid "KAIBARA'S VILLAGERS will heal T'CITHURA every turn"
msgstr "貝原村村民每回合都會治療齊修拉"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:39"
msgid "The fertility goddess has been caring for KAIBARA village for centuries, asking for human sacrifices in return."
msgstr ""
"豐饒女神數百年來都眷顧著貝原村。\n"
"為了回報祂，村民得用活人來獻祭。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:40"
msgid "KAIBARA'S VILLAGERS"
msgstr "貝原村村民"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:41"
msgid "the fertility goddess"
msgstr "豐饒女神"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:42"
msgid "You feel the urge to enter the water..."
msgstr "你萌生一股想進入水中的強烈欲望……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:43"
msgid "You want to join the fertility dance..."
msgstr "你想加入豐饒之舞的行列……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:44"
msgid "You feel strangely aroused..."
msgstr "你的性慾莫名高漲……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:45"
msgid "The mad ritual dance heals T'CITHURA! (+1 HEALTH)"
msgstr "瘋狂儀式的舞蹈治療了齊修拉！（+1 生命值）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:46"
msgid "MEAT HORROR"
msgstr "血肉詭怪"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:47"
msgid "Waves violently crash against the rocks as the gory horror begins to circle you..."
msgstr ""
"海浪激烈地拍打著岩石，\n"
"而這隻血腥的怪物也將你給逼到了角落……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:48"
msgid "Cursed by an ancient tablet he accidentally found, the marine biologist's skin began to act independently."
msgstr "在海洋生物學家被他意外發現的古代石板給詛咒之後，他的肌膚便開始產生自我意識。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:49"
msgid "MEAT HORROR attacks you!"
msgstr "血肉詭怪攻擊你！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:50"
msgid "MEAT HORROR scratches you!"
msgstr "血肉詭怪抓你！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:51"
msgid "MEAT HORROR bites you!"
msgstr "血肉詭怪咬你！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:52"
msgid "KABUKI KILLER"
msgstr "歌舞伎殺手"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:53"
msgid ""
"The masked man jumps from behind the door and you barely dodge his blade!\n"
"<<I can't let you leave this room...>>\n"
"\n"
"Are you going to become his last victim?"
msgstr ""
"面具男從門後跳出，你差點就被他的刀給砍中！\n"
"「休想離開這間房間……」\n"
"\n"
"你會成為他最後的受害者嗎？"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:54"
msgid "ASAO SHIRAISHI lost his daughter in an accident. Now, he is determined to do anything to bring her back."
msgstr ""
"白石朝雄在一場意外中失去了他的女兒。\n"
"只要能再看到他女兒一眼，他什麼都願意做。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:55"
msgid "the desperate father"
msgstr "絕望的父親"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:56"
msgid "KABUKI KILLER stabs you with his knife!"
msgstr "歌舞伎殺手用刀子捅你！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:57"
msgid "KABUKI KILLER slashes you across the face!"
msgstr "歌舞伎殺手砍你的臉！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:58"
msgid "KABUKI KILLER kicks you in your leg!"
msgstr "歌舞伎殺手踢中你的腿！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:59"
msgid "UNFINISHED CHILD"
msgstr "未完成的孩子"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:60"
msgid ""
"The masked man jumps from behind the door and you barely dodge his blade!\n"
"The KABUKI KILLER takes a step back, revealing his gruesome artwork - an unfinished statue of a child made of human nails.\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, the statue springs to life and bites the man's neck! The serial killer is visibly confused and tries to stop the bleeding as a geyser of blood paints the whole mortuary red.\n"
"\n"
"The being's face slowly turns towards you..."
msgstr ""
"面具男從門後跳出，你差點就被他的刀給砍中！\n"
"歌舞伎殺手後退一步，展示出他令人寒毛直豎的作品——用人類的指甲拼接而成，外觀看似兒童的一座未完成的雕像。\n"
"\n"
"這時，那座雕像突然活了過來，還咬掉了男人脖子上的一塊肉！明顯感到困惑的連環殺手想盡辦法要止血，但自己的鮮血已如同噴泉般不斷湧出，染紅了整個停屍間。\n"
"\n"
"那個東西將臉慢慢轉向你……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:61"
msgid "MANA SHIRAISHI was the KABUKI KILLER's daughter. The thing standing in front of you is her grotesque caricature."
msgstr "白石真夏曾是歌舞伎殺手的女兒，不過現在站在你面前的，不過是她怪異的仿製品而已。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:62"
msgid "UNFINISHED CHILD bites your arm!"
msgstr "未完成的孩子咬你的手臂！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:63"
msgid "UNFINISHED CHILD scratches you!"
msgstr "未完成的孩子抓你！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:64"
msgid "UNFINISHED CHILD bites your leg!"
msgstr "未完成的孩子咬你的腿！"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:65"
msgid "---ZHECTAST, THE HORROR FROM THE STARS---"
msgstr "——源自群星之恐怖 澤克塔蘇——"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:66"
msgid "A big meteorite fell down on a field in a village near SHIOKAWA. A farmer who found it contacted researchers from Tokyo, but when they arrived, all they found was a wet puddle of pinkish goo."
msgstr ""
"有個巨大的隕石，落到了鹽川附近的村子裡一塊田野上。\n"
"發現它的農夫聯絡了東京的研究者，但在他們抵達時，地上只剩下一灘粉紅色的黏液。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:67"
msgid "PERFECT FORM: Every 21% of DOOM, characters receive -1 to all stats."
msgstr "完美型態：每增加 21% 末日，角色就會失去 1 數值。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:68"
msgid "THE PERFECT FORM"
msgstr "完美型態"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:69"
msgid "A big meteorite fell down on a field in a village near SHIOKAWA. A farmer who found it contacted researchers from Tokyo, but when they arrived, all they found was a wet puddle of pinkish goo."
msgstr ""
"有個巨大的隕石，落到了鹽川附近的村子裡一塊田野上。\n"
"發現它的農夫聯絡了東京的研究者，但在他們抵達時，地上只剩下一灘粉紅色的黏液。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:70"
msgid "[every 21% DOOM lowers all your stats by 1]"
msgstr "[每增加 21% 末日就會使你的數值降低 1]"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:71"
msgid "You take a step towards the Perfect Form. (-1 ALL STATS)"
msgstr "你越來越接近完美型態。（-1 所有數值）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:72"
msgid "ZHECTAST"
msgstr "澤克塔蘇"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:73"
msgid "PERFECT FORM"
msgstr "完美型態"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:74"
msgid "every 21% DOOM lowers your stats by 1"
msgstr "每增加 21% 末日就會使你的數值降低 1"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:75"
msgid "---EH-ŻHAL, THE INCONCEIVABLE SADNESS---"
msgstr "——萬念俱灰之神 伊札爾——"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:76"
msgid "Slithering through the twisted tapestry of dimensions, the festering servants of EH-ŻHAL latch onto new vessels, ravenously devouring the very essence of human suffering, swelling their grotesque forms. Slowly but inevitably, the hosts succumb, their bodies and minds becoming one with the burgeoning god."
msgstr "伊札爾那些扭曲空間的使徒就像是一場瘟疫，在一個個宿主間不斷蔓延傳染，以他們的哀痛作為自身糧食，並在狼吞虎嚥中變得愈發臃腫，愈發沉重。不堪負荷的宿主最終將不支倒地，並與神融為一體。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:77"
msgid "AL-MISERY: Each mystery, a new status will start to weigh you down."
msgstr "苦難的深淵：調查謎團時，各種負面狀態將為你帶來沉重的負擔。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:78"
msgid "AL-MISERY"
msgstr "苦難的深淵"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:79"
msgid "each mystery, a new status will start to weigh you down"
msgstr "調查謎團時，各種負面狀態將為你帶來沉重的負擔。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:80"
msgid "EH-ŻHAL"
msgstr "伊札爾"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:81"
msgid "THE INCONCEIVABLE SADNESS"
msgstr "萬念俱灰之神"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:82"
msgid "The insidious PARASITE swells in size, its tendrils snaking ever deeper into the crevices of your existence..."
msgstr ""
"寄生蟲越長越大，你人生中越來越多的部分都將成為祂的目標，\n"
"直到你什麼都不剩。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:83"
msgid "At the end of the mystery, raise the DOOM by:"
msgstr "解開謎團時："

msgctxt "woh_ichi:84"
msgid "2% for each ALLY"
msgstr "每擁有一位夥伴提高 2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:85"
msgid "2% for each FUNDS"
msgstr "每持有 1 單位金錢提高 2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:86"
msgid "2% for each ITEM in inventory"
msgstr "物品欄中每放置 1 項物品提高 2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:87"
msgid "2% for each SPELL learned"
msgstr "每學習 1 道咒語提高 2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:88"
msgid "1% for every 10 EXP (rounded down)"
msgstr "每 10 經驗提高 1% 末日（下捨為整數）"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:89"
msgid "1% for each active INJURY"
msgstr "每項發作中的傷勢提高 1% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:90"
msgid "1% for each active CURSE"
msgstr "每項發作中的詛咒提高 1% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:91"
msgid "MISERY PARASITE"
msgstr "苦難寄生蟲"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:92"
msgid "MISERY PARASITE grows larger..."
msgstr "苦難寄生蟲越長越大……"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:93"
msgid "DOOM"
msgstr "末日"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:94"
msgid "It was only a matter of time. The MISERY PARASITES took almost everything from you. The last thing they took, after weeks of torture, was your life."
msgstr ""
"一切將要結束。被苦難寄生蟲奪去一切的你，僅剩下微弱的氣息。\n"
"在經歷幾週的折磨後，寄生蟲最終奪去的是……你的性命。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:95"
msgid "Once a human being, now you've become one with the God of the Inconceivable Sadness."
msgstr "曾是人類的你，如今卻和萬念俱灰之神融為一體。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:96"
msgid "Inconceivable Sadness"
msgstr "萬念俱灰之死"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:97"
msgid "if the mystery ended right now, DOOM would raise by"
msgstr "若謎團現在結束，末日將會提高"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:98"
msgid "Throw away 1 FUNDS"
msgstr "丟棄 1 金錢"

