msgid "MASOCHISTIC"
msgstr "受虐狂"

msgctxt "woh_perk:301"
msgid ""
"regain 1 REASON at the start of each enemy encounter;\n"
"-2 MAX REASON"
msgstr ""
"每次戰鬥開始時恢復 1 理智\n"
"-2 理智上限"

msgctxt "woh_perk:302"
msgid "<<...>>"
msgstr "「……」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:303"
msgid "You can't help but smile... (+1 REASON)"
msgstr "你發自內心感到愉悅……（+1 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_perk:304"
msgid "GHASTLY PRESENCE"
msgstr "背後靈"

msgctxt "woh_perk:305"
msgid ""
"disables all standard OFFENSIVE combat actions;\n"
"+4 MAX REASON"
msgstr ""
"無法使用所有標準的攻擊行動\n"
"+4 理智上限"

msgctxt "woh_perk:306"
msgid "<< ... >>"
msgstr "「……」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:307"
msgid "CAT'S CURIOSITY"
msgstr "貓一般的好奇心"

msgctxt "woh_perk:308"
msgid "deaths so far:"
msgstr "目前死亡次數："

msgctxt "woh_perk:309"
msgid "<<you could count on me>>"
msgstr "「交給我就對了」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:310"
msgid "SAFETY IN NUMBERS"
msgstr "人多勢眾"

msgctxt "woh_perk:311"
msgid ""
"[why did you sign that contract?]\n"
"\n"
"+1 MAX REASON\n"
"(at the end of the mystery): if you don't have at least 2 followers, lose 2 REASON"
msgstr ""
"[你怎麼會簽下那份合約？]\n"
"\n"
"+1 理智上限\n"
"（謎團結束時）：\n"
"若你沒擁有至少 2 名夥伴，\n"
"就會失去 2 理智"

msgctxt "woh_perk:312"
msgid "<<he's looking for you>>"
msgstr "「他正在找你」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:313"
msgid "Chaos rises! All STATS improved!"
msgstr "混亂崛起！所有數值提升！"

msgctxt "woh_perk:314"
msgid ""
"THE OLD GOD STIRS...\n"
"(click here to reveal its effect)"
msgstr ""
"古神降下了災厄……\n"
"（點選此處查看效果）"

msgctxt "woh_perk:315"
msgid "「STORE CLOSED」"
msgstr "「商店關門」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:316"
msgid "The [SHOP] additional action is disabled."
msgstr "無法進行[商店]這個額外行動。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:317"
msgid "The friendly dog disappeared last night. You will have to find a new place to buy equipment..."
msgstr "友善的狗狗昨晚消失了。你必須找新的地方來購買裝備……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:318"
msgid "「ROADS CLOSED」"
msgstr "「路段封鎖」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:319"
msgid "Investigating places located outside the city (VILLAGE, MANSION, FOREST) costs 1% more DOOM."
msgstr "調查城鎮外的地點（村子、豪宅、森林）會再提高 1% 末日。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:320"
msgid "Roads leading out of town were closed by the police. You'll have to find a new way out..."
msgstr "通往城鎮外的道路遭到警方封鎖。你必須另外找一條路走……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:321"
msgid "「SCHOOL BURNED DOWN」"
msgstr "「燒毀的學校」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:322"
msgid "While classes will continue in an old wing, no student will gather in the schoolyard."
msgstr "雖然課程會繼續在學校的舊校區進行，但學生將不會聚集在校園內。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:323"
msgid "While classes will continue in an old wing, no student will gather in the schoolyard."
msgstr "雖然課程會繼續在學校的舊校區進行，但學生將不會聚集在校園內。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:324"
msgid "「RIOTS」"
msgstr "「暴動」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:325"
msgid "Dangerous bands of rioters gather around the DOWNTOWN area."
msgstr "危險的暴走族盤踞在市區周圍。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:326"
msgid "Dangerous bands of rioters are gathering around the downtown area. The police are hopeless..."
msgstr "危險的暴走族盤踞在市區周圍。警方完全無能為力……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:327"
msgid "「WINDS OF PLAGUE」"
msgstr "「瘟疫之風」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:328"
msgid "TREATMENT and SURGERY actions cost more"
msgstr "進行治療與手術時的花費提高"

msgctxt "woh_perk:329"
msgid "A weird epidemic keeps staff at the hospital busy. Skipping the line will cost you more..."
msgstr "詭異的傳染病讓醫院員工忙不過來。要插隊就得付更多錢……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:330"
msgid "「CUT OFF FROM THE OUTSIDE WORLD」"
msgstr "「與外界斷絕聯繫」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:331"
msgid "The whole town stopped receiving any outside signal. It must be the radio mast failure..."
msgstr ""
"整座城鎮都收不到任何外界的訊號。\n"
"一定是無線電塔故障了……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:332"
msgid "The whole town stopped receiving any outside signal. It must be the radio mast failure..."
msgstr "整座城鎮都收不到任何外界的訊號。一定是無線電塔故障了……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:333"
msgid "「FETID FUMES」"
msgstr "「臭氣沖天」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:334"
msgid "Your REST action is less effective."
msgstr "休息的效果變差。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:335"
msgid "The air feels heavy, making it hard to breathe..."
msgstr "外頭糟糕的空氣，使人難以呼吸……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:336"
msgid "「CONTAMINATED WATER」"
msgstr "「水污染」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:337"
msgid "You can't regain health in between mysteries."
msgstr "無法在謎團之間恢復生命值。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:338"
msgid "There's something wrong with the tap water. It is black and oily and glistening, smelling like death. You hope it's just a temporary issue..."
msgstr "自來水似乎出了點問題。從水龍頭出來的水變得又黑又油亮，聞起來還有死亡的味道。你希望這只是暫時性的問題……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:339"
msgid "「ARCANE STORM」"
msgstr "「奧術風暴」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:340"
msgid "REASON cost of all SPELLS is increased by 1."
msgstr "使用咒語時花費的理智提高 1。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:341"
msgid "Local scientists are baffled. An unprecedented aurora-like event has bathed the entire town in an unnatural green glow..."
msgstr ""
"當地科學家感到十分困惑。\n"
"前所未見的某種類極光，將整座城鎮籠罩在詭異的綠光之下……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:342"
msgid "「PRICE HIKE」"
msgstr "「物價高漲」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:343"
msgid "All shop ITEMS cost 1 FUNDS more."
msgstr "購買任何商店中的物品都得多花費 1 金錢。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:344"
msgid "Preparing for the worst, people are stocking up on everything, making it harder for you to find what you want."
msgstr "人們做好最壞的打算後，開始囤積各類物品，讓你更難買到自己要的東西。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:345"
msgid "「FREAKY FLOOD」"
msgstr "「洪水氾濫」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:346"
msgid "Exploring the SEASIDE location has a chance of inflicting DRENCHED status."
msgstr "探索海邊有機率造成濕漉狀態。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:347"
msgid "Did the water level suddenly increase or is our city slowly sinking?"
msgstr "究竟是海平面在上升，還是我們的城市在緩慢下沉？"

msgctxt "woh_perk:348"
msgid "「HEART OF DARKNESS」"
msgstr "「黑暗之心」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:349"
msgid "Lighthouse gets one additional floor."
msgstr "燈塔多加一層樓。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:350"
msgid "The imposing shadow cast by the old lighthouse is getting longer each day..."
msgstr "老舊燈塔的陰影一天一天變長……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:351"
msgid "「SCHOOL CURFEW」"
msgstr "「學校戒嚴」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:352"
msgid "The [LIBRARY] additional action is disabled."
msgstr "無法使用[圖書館]這個額外行動。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:353"
msgid "With more and more students going missing, the police have restricted access to the school's building."
msgstr "由於越來越多學生失蹤，警方已封鎖學校的大樓。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:354"
msgid "「TIME SKIP」"
msgstr "「時光飛逝」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:355"
msgid "+5% DOOM"
msgstr "+5% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_perk:356"
msgid "What? I'd have sworn it was Monday, not Tuesday... right?"
msgstr "今天禮拜二！？我以為今天才禮拜一耶……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:357"
msgid "「BLOOD MOON」"
msgstr "「血月」"

msgctxt "woh_perk:358"
msgid "All enemies get additional 20 POWER."
msgstr "所有敵人增加 20 活力。"

msgctxt "woh_perk:359"
msgid "The crimson moon spotted over SHIOKAWA keeps everyone on the edge..."
msgstr "當暗紅色的月亮出現在鹽川上空時，所有人都緊張得難以成眠……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:360"
msgid "The flooded areas make it harder to navigate. (+ STATUS)"
msgstr "走在被水淹沒的區域使你感到行動不易（+ 狀態）"

msgctxt "woh_perk:361"
msgid "The ocean is calling you..."
msgstr "海洋正在呼喚你……"

msgctxt "woh_perk:362"
msgid "You must enter the water. (-1 REASON)"
msgstr "你必須進到海水裡……（-1 理智）"

msgctxt "woh_perk:363"
msgid "The underwater city is rising. (+1% DOOM)"
msgstr "海底城市冒出了水面。（+1% 末日）"

msgctxt "woh_perk:364"
msgid "You continue to change. (-1 STAMINA)"
msgstr "你持續在改變。（-1 體力）"

msgctxt "woh_san:0"
msgid "HUNTED HEIRESS"
msgstr "逃亡中的女繼承人"

msgctxt "woh_san:1"
msgid ""
"Name: JURI OKUSAWA\n"
"21 / FEMALE\n"
" \n"
"Something terrible is stalking JURI and with each passing day, its presence is getting nearer and nearer..."
msgstr ""
"姓名：奧澤樹里\n"
"21 歲/女性\n"
" \n"
"某個恐怖的「東西」正跟在樹里身後。\n"
"而隨著時間過去，\n"
"它的身影也越來越靠近……"

msgctxt "woh_san:2"
msgid ""
"+ PERCEPTION\n"
"- DEXTERITY\n"
"starts with FAMILY CURSE"
msgstr ""
"+ 感知\n"
"- 敏捷\n"
"遊戲開始時持有家族詛咒"

msgctxt "woh_san:3"
msgid "JURI"
msgstr "樹里"

msgctxt "woh_san:4"
msgid "RUNAWAY JACKET"
msgstr "逃亡外套"

msgctxt "woh_san:5"
msgid "ATTACK THE TEACHER"
msgstr "攻擊教師"

msgctxt "woh_san:6"
msgid "Maybe if you defeat them, the horror will end?"
msgstr "如果你擊敗了教師，這恐怖或許就會結束。"

msgctxt "woh_san:7"
msgid "You attack the teacher, dealing 7 DAMAGE."
msgstr "你攻擊了教師，造成 7 傷害。"

msgctxt "woh_san:8"
msgid "You attack the teacher, dealing 10 DAMAGE."
msgstr "你攻擊了教師，造成 10 傷害。"

msgctxt "woh_san:9"
msgid "MAGICK SWEATER"
msgstr "魔法毛衣"

msgctxt "woh_san:10"
msgid "The HORROR is slowly getting closer."
msgstr "那恐怖的「東西」正在慢慢靠近你……"

msgctxt "woh_san:11"
msgid "It's too late now."
msgstr "已經太遲了。"

msgctxt "woh_san:12"
msgid "ELUSIVE"
msgstr "捉摸不定"

msgctxt "woh_san:13"
msgid "-5% DOOM"
msgstr "-5% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_san:14"
msgid "TEST OF WILL"
msgstr "意志的考驗"

msgctxt "woh_san:15"
msgid ""
"+2 KNOWLEDGE\n"
"+2% DOOM"
msgstr ""
"+2 知識\n"
"+2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_san:16"
msgid "ESCAPEE"
msgstr "逃亡者"

msgctxt "woh_san:17"
msgid ""
"+2 DEXTERITY\n"
"+2% DOOM"
msgstr ""
"+2 敏捷\n"
"+2% 末日"

msgctxt "woh_san:18"
msgid "ON THE RUN"
msgstr "亡命之徒"

msgctxt "woh_san:19"
msgid "until the HORROR catches you, leveling up costs 50 EXPERIENCE less"
msgstr "在那恐怖的「東西」抓到你之前，升級所需的經驗值減少 50"

msgctxt "woh_san:20"
msgid "<<it's getting closer>>"
msgstr "「它離你不遠了」"

msgctxt "woh_san:21"
msgid "<<Here's our chance!>>"
msgstr "「機會來了！」"

msgctxt "woh_san:22"
msgid "<<Attack the enemy!>>"
msgstr "「上啊！」"

msgctxt "woh_san:23"
msgid "<<We are winning!>>"
msgstr "「就差一點了！」"

msgctxt "woh_san:24"
msgid "<<Surround the enemy!>>"
msgstr "「包圍敵人！」"

msgctxt "woh_san:25"
msgid "ORDER YOUR ALLIES TO ATTACK"
msgstr "指揮夥伴進行攻擊"

msgctxt "woh_san:26"
msgid "FLASH combat action adds a chance to dodge the incoming attack"
msgstr ""
"執行「相機閃光燈」時，\n"
"將額外提升成功閃避敵人攻擊的機率"

msgctxt "woh_san:27"
msgid "looking for an improvised weapon results in two items, instead of one"
msgstr "在尋找臨時武器時一次發現了兩項物品"

msgctxt "woh_san:28"
msgid "fell out of a window!"
msgstr "從陽台墜落摔死了！"

msgctxt "woh_san:29"
msgid "was hit by a truck!"
msgstr "被卡車給撞死了！"

msgctxt "woh_san:30"
msgid "tripped and broke their neck!"
msgstr "跌倒的時候摔斷了脖子！"

msgctxt "woh_san:31"
msgid "walked into an empty elevator shaft!"
msgstr "不小心掉進空蕩蕩的電梯井！"

msgctxt "woh_san:32"
msgid "was struck by lighting!"
msgstr "被雷給劈死了！"

msgctxt "woh_san:33"
msgid "suddenly died!"
msgstr "突然意外猝死！"

