msgctxt "woh_small:17"
msgid "--TRINKET (SLOT C)--"
msgstr "——雜物（C 欄）——"

msgctxt "woh_small:18"
msgid "STEAK KNIFE"
msgstr "牛排刀"

msgctxt "woh_small:19"
msgid "The sharpened edge can slice through the toughest cuts of meat. You can only hope that the red stains are from steak..."
msgstr "那鋒利的刀刃可以切開任何堅硬的肉塊。希望上面的紅色污漬是切牛排時沾上的……"

msgctxt "woh_small:20"
msgid "You hold onto your STEAK KNIFE, preparing for combat."
msgstr "你握緊手中的牛排刀準備戰鬥。"

msgctxt "woh_small:21"
msgid "weird red stains..."
msgstr "詭異的紅色污漬……"

msgctxt "woh_small:22"
msgid "CAMERA"
msgstr "相機"

msgctxt "woh_small:23"
msgid "1 KNOWLEDGE"
msgstr "+1 知識"

msgctxt "woh_small:24"
msgid "High quality lens, ready in a flash. A solid choice with an ample supply of film."
msgstr "隨時可以拍攝的高品質鏡頭。具備充足底片膠捲的可靠選擇。"

msgctxt "woh_small:25"
msgid "You take a photo with flash, disorienting the enemy!"
msgstr "你開啟閃光燈拍照，將敵人給閃瞎了！"

msgctxt "woh_small:26"
msgid "sturdy camera"
msgstr "耐用的相機"

msgctxt "woh_small:27"
msgid "[TECHNOLOGY]"
msgstr "[科技]"

msgctxt "woh_small:28"
msgid "[OFFENSIVE]"
msgstr "[攻擊]"

msgctxt "woh_small:29"
msgid "[ACTION]"
msgstr "[行動]"

msgctxt "woh_small:30"
msgid "--TECHNIQUE--"
msgstr "——技術——"

msgctxt "woh_small:31"
msgid "STEEL PIPE"
msgstr "鋼管"

msgctxt "woh_small:32"
msgid "(use): adds a new action for later use in combat"
msgstr "（使用）：增加一項全新的行動。之後可在戰鬥中使用"

msgctxt "woh_small:33"
msgid "Crude, but easy to use and powerful. You're unsure whether it's the rust you're smelling or the dried blood."
msgstr "雖然簡陋，但威力強大又很好上手。你不確定自己聞到的是鐵鏽味，還是血乾掉的味道。"

msgctxt "woh_small:34"
msgid "With great effort, you take a swing and bash the enemy with your STEEL PIPE!"
msgstr "你奮力揮舞鋼管，痛打敵人！"

msgctxt "woh_small:35"
msgid "a good sidearm"
msgstr "好用的隨身武器"

msgctxt "woh_small:36"
msgid "NICE RING"
msgstr "華麗的戒指"

msgctxt "woh_small:37"
msgid ""
"(equip): +1 CHARISMA\n"
"(use): gain 2 FUNDS"
msgstr ""
"（裝備）：+1 魅力\n"
"（使用）：獲得 2 金錢"

msgctxt "woh_small:38"
msgid "A fancy ring, turned up during an investigation. No weird markings, you could try to sell it."
msgstr ""
"調查時找到的一枚精美的戒指。\n"
"上面沒有任何詭異的標記，你可以試著拿去賣掉。"

