msgctxt "woh_ui:178"
msgid "Start your playthrough with a randomly chosen timeline."
msgstr "隨機挑選一條時間線開始遊戲。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:179"
msgid ""
"TIMELINE A\n"
"(WORLD OF HORROR)\n"
"Timeline choice determines changes in mysteries and their endings."
msgstr ""
"時間線 A\n"
"(WORLD OF HORROR)\n"
"不同的時間線會決定謎團結局的走向。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:180"
msgid ""
"TIMELINE B\n"
"(OCCULT CAPITAL OF JAPAN)\n"
"Every year, our city is visited by hundreds of tourists interested in the paranormal."
msgstr ""
"時間線 B\n"
"（日本的神秘之都）\n"
"每年都有數百位對超自然深感興趣的遊客，會來參觀這座怪異的城鎮。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:181"
msgid "story"
msgstr "劇情"

msgctxt "woh_ui:182"
msgid "easy"
msgstr "簡單"

msgctxt "woh_ui:183"
msgid "normal"
msgstr "普通"

msgctxt "woh_ui:184"
msgid "hard"
msgstr "困難"

msgctxt "woh_ui:185"
msgid "v.hard"
msgstr "非常困難"

msgctxt "woh_ui:186"
msgid "Start your playthrough with a randomly chosen difficulty level"
msgstr "遊戲開始時隨機挑選難易度"

msgctxt "woh_ui:187"
msgid "Get the full gameplay experience with a selection of tiny changes to make the dreadful town of SHIOKAWA a more hospitable place."
msgstr "經過一些微幅的調整後，就連鹽川這座恐怖的小鎮也變得更好親近，你也能獲得較完整的遊戲體驗。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:188"
msgid "Something weird is happening here but I'm sure that together, we can deal with it!"
msgstr ""
"雖然詭異的事件層出不窮，\n"
"但只要我們能團結起來，就沒什麼好怕的！"

msgctxt "woh_ui:189"
msgid "Evil forces are gathering around SHIOKAWA. Let's hope we can make it out alive..."
msgstr ""
"邪惡勢力已聚集在鹽川四周。\n"
"希望我們能活著逃出去……"

msgctxt "woh_ui:190"
msgid "We can't save everyone but we have to try."
msgstr "我們拯救不了所有人，但還是要用盡全力。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:191"
msgid "This place is doomed, flee while you still can!"
msgstr "這裡注定要毀滅的。你還是快逃吧！"

msgctxt "woh_ui:192"
msgid ""
"WORLD OF HORROR\n"
"BASE GAME\n"
"\n"
"Card pack containing everything you need to play this 1bit horror investigation game."
msgstr ""
"《WORLD OF HORROR》\n"
"基礎遊戲\n"
"\n"
"此卡片組合包含遊玩此 1 位元恐怖調查遊戲所需的一切。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:193"
msgid ""
"WORLD OF HORROR\n"
"UNLOCKABLES\n"
"\n"
"Contains all cards you've unlocked through achievements."
msgstr ""
"《WORLD OF HORROR》\n"
"可解鎖卡片\n"
"\n"
"包含所有你目前透過達成\n"
"成就解鎖的卡片。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:194"
msgid ""
"WORLD OF HORROR\n"
"MORE STUDENTS\n"
"\n"
"Contains additional\n"
"4 skins for random student allies."
msgstr ""
"《WORLD OF HORROR》\n"
"更多學生\n"
"\n"
"新增四種學生夥伴的外觀。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:195"
msgid "Contains additional eight events and encounters"
msgstr "包含額外的八起事件與戰鬥"

msgctxt "woh_ui:196"
msgid "[unlock while playing]"
msgstr "[遊玩時解鎖]"

msgctxt "woh_ui:197"
msgid "Contains additional five events and encounters."
msgstr "包含額外的五起事件與戰鬥。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:198"
msgid "Contains three additional mysteries."
msgstr "包含三个额外的谜团。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:199"
msgid ""
"One of the core ideas behind WORLD OF HORROR is modularity, allowing you to mix and match various card packs with different content.\n"
"\n"
"Simply select card packs you want to be included and continue by pressing the arrow on the bottom."
msgstr ""
"《WORLD OF HORROR》的核心概念之一就是彈性度。你將能透過混搭各種卡片組合來創造不同的遊戲體驗。\n"
"\n"
"只要點選你想加進遊戲中的卡片組合，再點選底下的選項就能繼續進行遊戲。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:200"
msgid ""
"One last thing... a tall man left a suitcase for you this morning. He said you will know the password.\n"
"\n"
"...I wonder, what could that mean?"
msgstr ""
"還有一件事……今天早上有個高大的男人留給你一只手提箱。\n"
"他說你會知道密碼是多少。\n"
"\n"
"……不知道那句話是什麼意思？"

msgctxt "woh_ui:201"
msgid ""
"[CITY OF SHIOKAWA, JAPAN. 198X]\n"
"SOMETHING STRANGE IS HAPPENING IN OUR TOWN..."
msgstr ""
"[日本鹽川市，198X 年]\n"
"這個城鎮有什麼正在蠢蠢欲動……"

msgctxt "woh_ui:202"
msgid ""
"ROBED FIGURES CAN BE SEEN GATHERING IN THE WOODS AT NIGHT. PEOPLE ARE GOING MISSING.\n"
"DISGUSTING CREATURES ARE TERRORIZING THE SEASIDE..."
msgstr ""
"身穿長袍的人們聚集在夜晚的森林裡。失蹤人口不斷增加。\n"
"醜惡的生物侵擾著海邊……"

msgctxt "woh_ui:203"
msgid ""
"THE RAPID TECHNOLOGICAL PROGRESS OF THE MODERN ERA BRINGS COMFORT...\n"
"BUT ALSO NEW UNKNOWN THREATS."
msgstr ""
"科技的快速進步為現代社會帶來了舒適……\n"
"但也帶來了前所未見的威脅。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:204"
msgid ""
"OLD GODS, MALICIOUS ELDRITCH BEINGS WHO RULED THE EARTH EONS AGO,\n"
"ARE AWAKENING AS REALITY STARTS TO CRUMBLE..."
msgstr ""
"在億萬年前統治著地球的駭異之物——古神，\n"
"也隨著現實的崩解而漸漸甦醒……"

msgctxt "woh_ui:205"
msgid ""
"ARMED WITH CLUES, SPELLS, AND YOUR DWINDLING SANITY, YOU'LL INVESTIGATE\n"
"MYSTERIES ACROSS THE CITY... AND IN REALMS BEYOND."
msgstr ""
"你將運用線索、咒語，以及自身不斷失去的理智，著手調查\n"
"存在於這座城市……以及存在於不同維度的謎團。"

msgctxt "woh_ui:206"
msgid ""
"AN OLD TRAIN SLOWS DOWN AND STOPS AT ITS LAST STATION.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"THE END OF THE WORLD IS AT HAND, AND YOU'VE FINALLY ARRIVED IN THE DOOMED TOWN..."
msgstr ""
"老舊的電車緩慢地停靠在終點站。\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"世界末日近在眼前，而你也抵達這座注定毀滅的城鎮……"

